{"3484830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEO VANDAL", "steam_appid": 3484830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5058640], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo Vandal is a cyberpunk incremental game where destruction is your business. Your job is simple - destroy corporate property, upgrade your weapons and abilities, create chaos, and get paid for it. And if you're feeling really adventurous, risk all that you earned by taking your time-limited run into Overtime and make those numbers go sky-high before you get caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed destruction</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tear through hundreds of realistic sci-fi equipment each having unique animations and reactions to damage. Watch your symphony of destuction and see the property damage counter go up, up, and up. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast skill tree improving your way of chaos. Buy and upgrade unique weapons and hire crew to help you destroy corpo property efficiently and in style. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overtime risk-reward mechanic</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your timed destuction runs over the limit and see if you can increase your pay out even more! However, Overtime is risky business - you never know when you'll get caught and loose it all. Make sure to control that dopamine rush and bail out in time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the story</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/9e2bf1d979b7c63a598f006b906d8a17.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/9e2bf1d979b7c63a598f006b906d8a17.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/9e2bf1d979b7c63a598f006b906d8a17.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all meaningless, mindless violence and destruction. Through you actions you've entangled into a web of corporate rivalry, undeground hackers, and a greater conspiracy. A tough choice will need to be made along the way.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo Vandal is a cyberpunk incremental game where destruction is your business. Your job is simple - destroy corporate property, upgrade your weapons and abilities, create chaos, and get paid for it. And if you're feeling really adventurous, risk all that you earned by taking your time-limited run into Overtime and make those numbers go sky-high before you get caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed destruction</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/860d5a8a6daca272c7768a3c343a97ca.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tear through hundreds of realistic sci-fi equipment each having unique animations and reactions to damage. Watch your symphony of destuction and see the property damage counter go up, up, and up. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/051dd4f791ef252f21462d7abf75597a.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast skill tree improving your way of chaos. Buy and upgrade unique weapons and hire crew to help you destroy corpo property efficiently and in style. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overtime risk-reward mechanic</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.webm?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/07507725f128acd1765289b891e1c731.mp4?t=1785965770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your timed destuction runs over the limit and see if you can increase your pay out even more! However, Overtime is risky business - you never know when you'll get caught and loose it all. Make sure to control that dopamine rush and bail out in time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the story</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484830/extras/9e2bf1d979b7c63a598f006b906d8a17.poster.avif?t=1785965770\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\